            <div xml:id="d122-a2">

                <pb facs="0212" n="946" xml:id="pg946"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex No. 1</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of inquest on A. J.
                    Hixon</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">verdict.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>That the said A. J. Hixon came to his death on the morning of the 11th instant,
                    in the town of Eouse, hy being struck on the head by some blunt instrument,
                    probably the weapon produced in evidence, the inj uries being inflicted by the
                    hands of Lorenzo Danino and others} and we further believe that the same was
                    committed with felonious intent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. R. Hudwan Herman</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. D. Leonard</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Walter Holt</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. D. Lee</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jno. Priett</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sam Nayman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Jurors.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. Mathews</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Coroner.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
